    "text_excerpt": " ```python\nfrom sympy import symbols, IndependentSet\n\n# Define the variables\nA, B, C, D, E = symbols('A B C D E')\n\n# Define the edges\nedges = [(A, B), (B, C), (C, D), (D, E), (E, A)]\n\n# Check independence and find the largest independent set\nindependent_sets = []\nfor i in range(1, len(edges) + 1):\n    for combo in combinations(edges, i):\n        if IndependentSet(combo).is_independent():\n            independent_sets.append(combo)\n\nlargest_set = max(independent_sets, key=len)\nprint(\"The largest independent set is:\", largest_set)\n ```\n\nThe largest independent set includes the vertices {A, C, E}. Therefore, the solution shows that these vertices satisfy the independence condition based on the given edges."
